Carafe Lab: track indirect storage pointers through deeper addition trees.
Search both words through at most 128 additive nodes instead of one low-word add and
two high-word adds. Match words from the same loaded pointer and reject conflicting
descriptor pairs. Nested constant IAdd64 offsets are accumulated with signed bounds;
descriptor offsets use wide arithmetic. Masks, shifts, Phi and Select are not treated
as transparent pointer operations. Their provenance requires additional proof.
Direct pointers require adjacent constant cbuf words with matching indices and alignment.
Computed offsets require the high word to add the exact carry of the low-word addition.
GPL-3.0-or-later, as the file it changes.

